# Fixture: map_found_colony start (France 1599, Preacher selected at (44,22)). Nothing in the game is touched.
# The Alt-W, Alt-I, Alt-N unlock writes head.game_options.cheats_enabled (DS:0x5383 bit5, FUN_2b5a_3094 raw 45007) and the CHEAT title follows it.
# Unlike map_cheat_*, this test does NOT end with Alt-W: the saved bit stays set, the only difference from input.sav.
# The counter DS:0xb92 advances only on the exact next key and any other key resets it (FUN_2b5a_32a2): Alt-W, Alt-I, Alt-C (COLONIZOPEDIA menu), Escape, Alt-N leaves CHEAT hidden.
key w alt
key i alt
key c alt                # any other key resets the sequence (opens the COLONIZOPEDIA menu)
key Escape               # closes the menu only
key n alt
key c alt                # still locked: Alt-C opens COLONIZOPEDIA again
shot
key Escape
key w alt
key w alt                # a second Alt-W does not restart the sequence (counter 1 expects I)
key i alt
key n alt
key c alt                # still locked: COLONIZOPEDIA
shot
key Escape
key w alt
key i alt
key n alt                # unlocked: CHEAT title appears, bit set
shot
key c alt                # Alt-C opens the CHEAT menu
shot
key Escape
